  {
   "address": 17408,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The title picture's bitmap, its second kilobyte."
  },
  {
   "address": 17672,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Where the two pictures differ: 71 bytes from here to $4A17 hold the first letter of SUMMER."
  },
  {
