  },
  {
   "address": 40768,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Entry: reads the keyboard's first column, and when F3, DEL and cursor down are all held, and nothing else there, copies the second picture over the first before showing it."
  },
  {
   "address": 40797,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copies $8000-$96FF over the bitmap at $4000, a page at a time, the loop raising the pages in its own operands."
  },
  {
   "address": 40801,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The page the copy reads, raised by the loop."
  },
  {
   "address": 40804,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The page the copy writes, raised by the loop until it reaches $57."
  },
  {
   "address": 40821,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copies the first two pages of the second picture's screen colours and colour memory over the first's."
  },
  {
   "address": 40851,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "An older copy of the wait, which nothing calls."
